# React build output — generated from apps/web
/backend/priv/static/app/
/backend/priv/static/cache_manifest.json
# mix phx.digest output — digested copies of the tracked sources and their
# gzip siblings. Rebuilt by `mix assets.deploy` (Dockerfile, and the
# compile step of scripts/verify-preview.sh), so a checkout must not carry
# them: cache_manifest.json is ignored, which leaves them unreferenced and
# free to go stale.
/backend/priv/static/**/*-????????????????????????????????.*
/backend/priv/static/**/*.gz

